<p>The above solvers were run on an Intel Xeon E5-4657L (48 cores, 512GB) on the
continuous<br> non-convex problems (<a href="http://plato.asu.edu/ftp/cnconv.pdf">102 total</a>) from
<a href="http://qplib.zib.de">QPLIB</a>.
